taosync-csenc
=============

This software is a modified version of TaoSync
  https://github.com/dr34m-cn/taosync

Original project author: dr34m (dr34m-cn)
License: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE)

Modifications (maintainer: yudeyu9), including but not limited to:
  - Synology / NAS oriented Docker packaging under deploy/synology/
  - Synology Cloud Sync compatible encryption (service/crypto/csenc.py)
  - Documentation and branding adjustments for this fork

The name "TaoSync" and related marks belong to the upstream project.
This fork is distributed under the name taosync-csenc to reduce confusion
with the official releases and Docker image (dr34m/tao-sync).
